            "text": "Under Maharashtra government regulations, Mamurdi (PCMC) stamp duty is 7% for standard purchases (including 5% base stamp duty, 1% local body tax, and 1% transport surcharge). A 1% concession applies to female sole ownership (6% total), with a flat registration fee of ₹30,000 for properties valued above ₹30 Lakhs."
